            "description": "Search medicines evaluated through EMA's centralised procedure (EU EPAR medicine pages): name, EMA product number, status (Authorised, Withdrawn, Refused, ...), INN, active substance, ATC code, therapeutic area, marketing authorisation holder, procedure dates and flags such as orphan, generic, biosimilar and conditional approval. Filter by words, category or status, or resolve one ema_product_number. Therapeutic indications are withheld. Every result carries EMA attribution.\n\nThe response contains the tool result directly.\n\nThe provider identifies `records` as the primary payload key.\n\n| Documented field | Provider type | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `data` | object | EMA's row for this medicine with its original keys, all strings; empty string means EMA published no value. Fields in withheld_fields are removed. |\n| `ema_product_number` | string |  |\n| `medicine_url` | string | EMA medicine (EPAR) page. |\n| `name_of_medicine` | string |  |\n\n\nThese are the provider's documented fields. Field requiredness, nullability and nested object structures are specified only where the descriptions explicitly say so."
          },
